Use stage variables for a REST API in API Gateway
Stage variables are key-value pairs that you can define as configuration attributes associated with
a deployment stage of a REST API. They act like environment variables and can be used in your API
setup and mapping templates. With deployment stages in API Gateway, you can manage multiple
