Note
Our NotifyingBucket construct inherits not from Bucket but rather from Construct.
We are using composition, not inheritance, to bundle an Amazon S3 bucket and an Amazon
SNS topic together. In general, composition is preferred over inheritance when developing
AWS CDK constructs.
